# Several reads grouped in one turn (docs/claude-code-reference.md §3:
# read-only calls group into a collapsed row while running). This harness
# has no built-in glob/grep tools (internal/tools/builtins.go registers
# only bash, read, edit, write), so the group is three `read` calls rather
# than read/glob/grep.
@faux testdata/faux/qa/tools-read-group.yaml
@fixture testdata/behaviour/design

WAITFOR /describe a task/ 20
TYPE map the upload path
KEY enter
WAITFOR /read ─/ 20
SHOT reads-committed
EXPECT /auth\.ts/
EXPECT /upload\.ts/
EXPECT /redisMock\.ts/
EXPECT /All three read/
EXPECT_NOT /panic|goroutine/
